{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想在 iPhone 上完整留存遊戲對戰、直播畫面或重要通話內容，EveryCord 正好符合需要。這款前身為 iRec 的螢幕錄影工具，適合遊戲玩家、內容創作者與經常需要保存通話紀錄的用戶，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>螢幕錄影直播通話全支援</h2>\n<p>EveryCord 提供順暢的 iOS 螢幕錄影體驗，無論錄製操作教學、遊戲畫面或 Snapchat 限時動態，細節皆能清晰呈現。程式同時支援直接於裝置串流至 YouTube 與 Twitch，亦可錄製語音及視訊通話內容，方便日後重溫或整理重點，並將每次數碼時刻完整保存下來。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-206-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-207-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-208-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-209-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-210-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-211-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：EveryCord: Live Screen Record</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T07:59:27.559157+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}